WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:08.520
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:15.030
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.860
It's my day!

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.440
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.850
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:42.220
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:49.630
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:55.400
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:02.540
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:10.050
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.190
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.260
I just want to walk

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.790
Not on tip-toe

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.760
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:35.670
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:42.110
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.380
It's my day!

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:48.920
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.860
<i>If you hadn't said anything
I would have been expelled.</i>

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.100
<i>I guess it's better this way.</i>

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:08.010
<i>I can't have both him and
Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:18.110
"Sleepless Night!"

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.320
<i>I guess it's better this way.</i>

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.090
<i>I can't have both her and Rui.</i>

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.460
What's with that guy?

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.900
Walking around in shorts
when it's so cold?

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.330
He must be crazy.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:45.040
He may be an easy mark.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.590
He looks pretty fit for a mark.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:00.690
Think we can take him?

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:06.500
Stupid! There are three of us.
He's so out of it, it'll be easy.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.330
Okay... Let me scope him out.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.500
Hey... You there...

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:19.470
What the...?

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.980
Hey! Get a load of him.
He's got this stupid look on his face.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.840
What kind of stupid look?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.750
It's not just his face.
Check the weird hair!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.980
Look! These curls stretch out.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:34.450
They look like caterpillars.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.520
What's with this guy?

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:39.920
Why don't you say something?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.860
Come on! Say something!

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:44.730
Weird guy...

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.230
Forget it.
Let's take what we can.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.640
Wow! A Brada wallet.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.970
Let's see how much he's got.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.940
Man! There must be at least
300,000 yen!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.110
What?!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.520
Look!

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.490
He's got 10 gold cards!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.520
Just how many does he carry...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:06.850
Car... Rui?

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.750
...in there?

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.190
Sorry...

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.330
Sor... Rui?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.490
...but we're taking all of 'em.

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:14.570
We'll have no need to worry...

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.070
<i>Wor... Rui?</i>

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.930
...with all this cash!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.070
Let's see...

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.480
What did you say?

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:41.360
Ah... This wine is wonderful.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.160
Why do you all look
so depressed?

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:53.770
Eat up! Enjoy yourselves! Enjoy!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.130
You just can't keep up
with Tsubaki.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.770
Give her a little wine
and she's amped.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.280
Come on, Tsukushi! Eat up!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.740
Y-yes, ma'am!

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:07.940
Are you all right?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:09.180
Yes...

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:15.620
You were all so little...
and now you're all grown up...

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.920
I'm impressed...

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.630
When you were kids,
you were as cute as dolls.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:37.570
And now you're old enough
to be fighting over girls...

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:43.540
<i>Fighting over girls?
I don't think that's it, exactly.</i>

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:48.180
<i>I still can't figure out
what Rui Hanazawa is thinking.</i>

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.650
<i>He's never told me
he loves me...</i>

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.190
<i>But...</i>

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.200
<i>He was so awesome on the court...</i>

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:10.500
<i>I'll stop time for you.</i>

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.510
<i>My heart never lies.</i>

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.710
By the way,
what's that dumb Tsukasa doing?

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.380
<i>Why does it have to be so honest?!</i>

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.320
I thought he'd come back in a funk...

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.420
so I wanted to cheer him up.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.990
He's probably
blowing off steam in town.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.960
Forget about that idiot.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.630
Bring us another bottle.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.680
<i>Domyoji...
What could he be doing?</i>

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.340
How dare you mention Rui to me!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.140
To hell with you and everybody else...

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.660
Makino and Rui...

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.490
How dare you both
take advantage of me!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.700
<i>Hit me if you want!</i>

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.100
<i>You're worse than a worm!</i>

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.240
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.210
First, put your finger there, then let go.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:32.580
See the two lights?

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:33.120
Yeah...

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:37.120
Where the two lines meet,
you'll find your fortune for today.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.610
"Someone will ask you out."

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:46.760
Okay, then let's see how far
Makino and Rui have gone.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:47.660
What?!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:54.620
I've been wanting to ask you.
How far have you two gone?

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:55.770
What?!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:08:00.310
How far? To Omotesando...

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.550
Listen, he's not asking you
where you went on your date.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.130
We want to know if...

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.480
...you've done it with her.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.050
No way!
Tsukushi wouldn't do that!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:11.720
Shut up!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.090
Let's find out for sure...
How far did they go?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:19.060
You too, Rui.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.000
Now, touch each other.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:24.770
That's right.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:26.270
Now let go.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.370
Let's see...

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.440
"Had Sex" it says.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.430
Naturally, I figured as much...

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.710
W-we haven't gone any farther
than kissing.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:40.880
For real?

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.150
You're kidding!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.680
I don't believe it.

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.920
So that's why...

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:49.120
I thought there was something
unnatural about you two.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.660
It's because you're
dragging your feet...

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:00.500
that Tsukasa is trying
to get between you.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:02.570
Rui!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.770
I'll let you use
one of our bedrooms.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.680
If you're a man... If you're a man...

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:09.840
Take action!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.480
Stop it, will you?

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.480
What are you trying to do
to my Tsukushi?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.770
T-Tsubaki!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.220
Sojiro! Akira!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.230
Wait a minute!

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.450
Makino... Don't go backing out!

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.150
Hang in there, Rui!

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.320
<i>What are they thinking?!</i>

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.840
Oh, jeez... How can they all...?

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:18.280
It's okay.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:22.910
It's okay with me.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.020
It's okay with me.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.820
<i>What does he mean,
"It's okay with me"?</i>

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.610
<i>Is this for real?
There's a bed here...</i>

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:27.110
<i>No one's coming in
until morning...</i>

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:33.080
Uh... Doesn't this...?

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.080
Doesn't this remind you
of your school trips?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.590
School trips?

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.320
Sure. You know...

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.160
Everyone in one room,
talking all night...

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.320
pillow fights...

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:46.260
When I was in middle school,
we went to Kyoto and Nara.

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.000
But we didn't see any
of the temples or statues...

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:54.440
W-what is it?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:00.170
What is it?

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:08.020
Up close, you aren't
very pretty at all...

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:11.140
Well, sorry! What's it to you?!

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:15.920
But when we were on the court...
you were trying so hard.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:20.860
It was cool to see this one girl
going all out among the boys.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:27.530
At first, I wondered why
Tsukasa was bothering with you.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.660
But now, I think I know...

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:35.610
<i>Answer this:</i>

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:39.150
<i>Were you interested in the girls
who tried to pick you up?</i>

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:44.820
<i>That's stupid! Of course not!</i>

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:55.960
I think I know now...

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.330
Really?

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:04.030
To be honest, I'm not sure
how I feel about you.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.540
But, there have been times
that I thought you were sweet.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.850
Sojiro and Akira said
I was going after you

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.320
because I couldn't have Shizuka...

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.090
True... I may have felt
somewhere in my heart

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:31.930
that I could use you
to forget Shizuka.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.300
But... I still...

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:45.110
<i>He's still pining for Shizuka...</i>

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:13.930
I'm sorry.

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.650
You don't have to apologize.

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:32.450
But...

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:37.490
If I hadn't come back,
you and Tsukasa...

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:41.990
I don't regret it.
Honest! I have no regrets.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.870
Dummy!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.010
You're a boy, aren't you?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.110
Don't cry because you fell!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.560
Tsukushi!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.430
Pipe down, <i>Nouveau Riche</i>!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.900
Do you think
they've gotten started?

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:23.100
I dunno... They're both a little shy.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.100
Stop being so vulgar!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.640
But Rui's a guy, right?

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:31.780
If he's locked in a room
with a girl, naturally...

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:33.150
He's not like you.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:38.120
Before a certain someone
forces himself on her...

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.490
I want Tsukushi to have
some wonderful memories.

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:44.620
Wonderful, wonderful memories.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.130
This is no way to give her
wonderful memories.

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:50.900
Chicks! Always wanting romance.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:52.770
Shut up!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:55.100
Rui and Makino?
That's more like a comedy!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:56.540
Tsukasa...

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:57.640
Tsukasa?

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:00.610
T-Tsukasa...

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:09.050
W-what are you doing
standing there?

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.220
You're still dressed like that?

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:14.550
You must be beat!
Why don't you go off to bed?

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:15.520
No!

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.820
You mustn't hide things like this.

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:23.800
Tsukasa, Rui and Tsukushi
are in the bedroom together.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.160
They probably won't come out
until morning.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:30.000
If you're a man,
you should take it like a man.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.440
You understand, don't you?

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.270
Uh-oh...

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.440
Hey, Tsukasa...
Don't blow your top, now.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.450
Well, good for Rui.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.020
Right? Way to go.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.620
Tsukasa...

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.160
You've accepted it?

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:57.430
Maybe you're
an okay guy, after all.

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:01.600
Whatever! I'm hungry.
Get me something to eat.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.500
Okay! Alert the cook.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.000
Okay.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:25.560
<i>Sleeping like a baby.
He looks angelic.</i>

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.460
<i>Some part of me always knew...</i>

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.530
<i>that Rui Hanazawa
couldn't forget Shizuka.</i>

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:42.040
<i>I knew all along...
that she had her sights on Rui.</i>

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.250
<i>But I... It was so exciting.</i>

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.120
<i>I had a wonderful time...</i>

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.150
<i>I won't let them expel us.</i>

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.310
<i>I have something I want to protect, too.</i>

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:38.110
<i>My heart still skips a beat
when I see his face...</i>

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.810
<i>I still like Rui Hanazawa, but...</i>

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:46.280
<i>Take it like a man?</i>

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:54.160
<i>Thank you, Rui Hanazawa...
for telling me the truth.</i>

00:20:57.590 --> 00:21:00.360
Oh... It's so bright!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:09.470
<i>Shizuka, it looks like
I can't win against you.</i>

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:13.480
<i>It hurts a little, but it's okay...</i>

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:16.210
<i>I'm Tsukushi, the weed, after all!</i>

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.180
I'm sleepy...

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.490
You're up already, Tsukasa?

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.160
Akira...

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:30.940
Sojiro...

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.830
I'm going to New York.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:38.040
I'm going to New York.

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:11.760
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:19.640
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:29.520
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:37.560
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:45.330
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:53.470
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:53.470
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.470 --> 00:23:01.850
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.470 --> 00:23:01.850
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:11.620
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:19.400
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:27.570
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:27.570
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:35.980
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:35.980
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:49.660
What?! Tsukasa's leaving school?

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:52.960
Listen... Why are you leaving?

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:56.100
Just because you couldn't have
Rui Hanazawa and me expelled,

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:58.930
you're ditching?
And overseas, even!

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:02.740
Hana Yori Dango:
"Domyoji Goes to New York!!"

00:24:03.740 --> 00:24:07.640
I never thought he'd go
so far away...
